  <p id="c-nanshi-048-lucheng-wangjian:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-048-lucheng-wangjian:p001:m0000" ref="77h_id3_a0i_AA">陸澄</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-048-lucheng-wangjian:p001:m0003" ref="77h_id3_a0i_AA">彥深</persName>，吳郡吳人也。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-048-lucheng-wangjian:p001:m0013" ref="77h_id3_a0i">劭</persName>，臨海太守。父<persName id="c-nanshi-048-lucheng-wangjian:p001:m0021" ref="77h_id3_a0i_A">瑗</persName>，州從事。</p>
